/**@addtogroup api-base
 * @details
 *
 * The base library provides fundamental features for the VidRe framework.
 * This includes, for example, configuration languages (such as JSON),
 * basic networking, module loading, etc. 
 * 
 * Note, that even so the GUI uses Qt which provides numerous equivalent 
 * abstractions, the recording deamon or service, respectively, is ultimately 
 * expected to run on a headless machine - and, therefore, should not depend
 * on Qt.
 * 
 * @{
 * @defgroup api-base-module    Dynamic module loading.
 * @defgroup api-base-util      Utilities.
 * @}
 * */

/**@defgroup api-base-details   Implementation details.
 * @ingroup api-base
